      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "……だけど、今日はたまたま\r\n魔石をひとつ持ってるから特別にあげるクポ。\r\nビジョンを強化してみるといいクポ。",
        "official_en": "Although, I <text style=\"italic\">guess</> I could give you a magicite since I happen to have one on me right now, kupo. Go on, try enhancing a vision, kupo.",
        "real_en": "...But I happen to have a magicite with me today, so I'll make a special exception and give it to you, kupo. Try enhancing a vision, kupo!"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
