        "official_en_sha256": "6009ee3f708e3047b686f142d3a4a936796ce7d4a2ad29b0583bf048493eb503"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ああ、わかった。\r\n光のモーグリ、これからもよろしく頼むぜ。",
        "official_en": "You got it. Thanks, moogle light. Counting on you.",
        "real_en": "All right, got it. Moogle of Light, I'm counting on you from now on."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
