    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C01_Moogle_01:SubEv_C01_Moogle_01_005:47fbb427",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_SubEv_C01_Moogle_01",
        "key": "SubEv_C01_Moogle_01_005",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C01_Moogle_01:SubEv_C01_Moogle_01_005:47fbb427",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C01_Moogle_01:SubEv_C01_Moogle_01_005:47fbb427",
        "jp_sha256": "e3f297f654d841bb70facb9b129ce950560c9dddaf94a860294a6092ca68e3bb",
        "official_en_sha256": "35d0227eaa7b238b893156940cb038d546af8bad31136b1b59326b5dfafe3b89"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "キミタチ、光の意思に会って\r\nビジョンの力をもらったクポ？\r\n光の意思は、異界を司るエラーイお方。",
        "official_en": "You boys met the Will of Light and received the power of visions, didn’t you, kupo? Well, the Will of Light’s the biggest of wigs that rules the Farplane, kupo.",
        "real_en": "You met the Will of Light and received the power of visions, didn't you, kupo? The Will of Light is a very important being who governs the Farplane, kupo!"
      },
      "review": {
